atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/e3d393ed0b984a09fd9a329a9cecb7ed.poster.avif?t=1788231477\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/e3d393ed0b984a09fd9a329a9cecb7ed.webm?t=1788231477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/e3d393ed0b984a09fd9a329a9cecb7ed.mp4?t=1788231477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/a7256a3b57ea5f2255068a51bf771439.poster.avif?t=1788231477\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/a7256a3b57ea5f2255068a51bf771439.webm?t=1788231477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/55c8cad07f6e4278542b2774ad3f7ac7.poster.avif?t=1788231477\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/55c8cad07f6e4278542b2774ad3f7ac7.webm?t=1788231477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/55c8cad07f6e4278542b2774ad3f7ac7.mp4?t=1788231477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dethlam. A ruthless prison state for occult offenders, where high-functioning inmates like you are put to work maintaining the prison. Encased within oppressive panopticon walls, every corner is watched, and every action judged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the prison’s package inspector, your task is to scrutinize every letter, parcel, and scrap of paper that arrives. What may seem like routine inspection hides a crushing moral burden. Each decision to allow or destroy contraband, coded messages or forbidden objects shapes not only your fate but the fragile livelihood of those trapped inside. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural Claymation Horror - Handmade, stop-motion inspired visuals. A slow burn narrative where paranoia and otherworldly forces twist the mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Methodical Inspection Gameplay - Examine each package with precision and restraint under constant pressure. Mistakes  carry irreversible consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Wisely - Balance duty, compassion, and survival as you decide what reaches the inmates and what burns in the incinerator. Your choices cannot be undone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occult Prison State Setting - Explore Dethlam’s burrowing panopticon, where high-functioning inmates are exploited for labor under unblinking surveillance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/fbc8a03d1693de4417a6d98607915082.poster.avif?t=1788231477\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/fbc8a03d1693de4417a6d98607915082.webm?t=1788231477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/extras/9876d860c38ce614249898733f021996.pos