 what burns in the incinerator. Your choices cannot be undone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occult Prison State Setting - Explore Dethlam’s burrowing panopticon, where high-functioning inmates are exploited for labor under unblinking surveillance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In a claymation prison for occult offenders, you are the package inspector. Search packages for hidden contraband, coded letters, and cursed objects. Balance duty, compassion, and survival as you decide what reaches the inmates and what burns in the incinerator. Your choices cannot be undone.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/27241a32d19194134f7d7410d3466d2c14fe5694/header.jpg?t=1788231477", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/9d50f5065c1ab31e2f79d581c855beb7b7f26aa4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788231477", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930970/9d50f5065c1ab31e2f79d581c855beb7b7f26aa4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788231477", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200, AMD Athlon XE BE-2300 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500 (Broadwell), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri) or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Subject to Change.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Joshua Allin"], "publishers": ["Joshua Allin"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"i